Place fitted model checkpoints here for the Docker deployment to pick up:
  - pca_scaler.pkl      (see quantum_dim_reduction.py)
  - qknee_model.pt      (see model_pipeline.py's save_checkpoint())

This directory is bind-mounted read-only into both containers at
/app/models (see docker-compose.yml), so new checkpoints can be dropped in
and picked up on container restart without rebuilding the image.
